@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #365879
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EEF4F8
hide empty members
title U03 类图：命令、世界与运行状态
class SimulationFacade <<Facade>> {
  +submit(envelope): CommandReceipt
}
class CommandInbox {
  +append(envelope)
}
class CommandEnvelope <<DTO>> {
  +command_id: str
  +request_id: str
  +run_id: str
  +kind: str
  +schema_version: int
  +payload: JSON
}
class CommandCodec {
  +decode(envelope): WorldCommand
}
class CommandProcessor <<Invoker>> {
  +process_next(run_id): ProcessResult
}
interface WorldCommand <<Command>> {
  +execute(world): EventDraft[]
}
class PublishNoticeCommand <<ConcreteCommand>>
class CloseLocationCommand <<ConcreteCommand>>
class ProposeActionCommand <<ConcreteCommand>>
class World <<Receiver, Originator>> {
  +publish_notice(command): EventDraft[]
  +close_location(command): EventDraft[]
  +propose_action(command): EventDraft[]
  +create_memento(): WorldMemento
}
interface RunState <<State>> {
  +classify(kind): Disposition
  +transition(kind): RunStatus
  +can_advance(): bool
}
class RunningState <<ConcreteState>>
class PausedState <<ConcreteState>>
class AgentState
class LocationState
class UnitOfWork {
  +commit()
  +rollback()
}
SimulationFacade --> CommandInbox
CommandInbox --> CommandEnvelope : 保存
CommandProcessor --> CommandCodec
CommandCodec ..> CommandEnvelope
CommandCodec ..> WorldCommand : 白名单解码
CommandProcessor --> WorldCommand : 调用execute
CommandProcessor --> UnitOfWork : 事务边界
CommandProcessor --> World : 加载/保存
WorldCommand <|.. PublishNoticeCommand
WorldCommand <|.. CloseLocationCommand
WorldCommand <|.. ProposeActionCommand
PublishNoticeCommand ..> World : 调用
CloseLocationCommand ..> World : 调用
ProposeActionCommand ..> World : 调用
World --> "1" RunState : 当前状态行为
RunState <|.. RunningState
RunState <|.. PausedState
World "1" *-- "8" AgentState
World "1" *-- "5" LocationState
note bottom of RunState
其他状态见U05：Draft / Ready / Finished / Failed。
状态码持久化；对象按状态码装配。
end note
note bottom of WorldCommand
命令对象无数据库/Redis/模型依赖。
去重和事务由Invoker负责。
end note
@enduml
